The MySQL Timeseries Server is a fork of the offcial Oracle MySQL repository, in which a specific storage engine has been added. This SE, called Sparrow, is focused on optimizing inserting and retrieval of timestamped data. To benefit from the performance optimization, data must be inserted in chronological order. 

The Sparrow SE has been added into branch 8.0 and 8.4. Insertion into trunbk is currenlty not planned. 
Integration development for branch 8.0 was done in sub-branch AB#340942-Use-Sparrow-timeseries-storage-engine-with-MySQL-8.0.
Integration development for branch 8.4 was done in sub-branch 454903-Add-Sparrow-storage-engine-to-MySQL-8.4.

The official release for MySQL Timeseries Server 8.0 is tag 4.4.3. 
The official release for MySQL Timeseries Server 8.4 is tag 4.4.4. 

5/5/2025
--------
Branch AB#340942-Use-Sparrow-timeseries-storage-engine-with-MySQL-8.0 was merged in branch 8.0.
Branch 454903-Add-Sparrow-storage-engine-to-MySQL-8.4 was merged into branch 8.4. 
